2 CONT '''David II''' succeeded his father to the throne of the Kingdom of Lori. He ruled with his brother Abbas I. Faced with expansion of Seljuq Turks and Bagratid Georgians, he transferred his capital to Matsnaberd in 1111, where he r
2 CONC uled till 1118.
