2 CONC DwBQ&ved=0CDEQ6AEwAw#v=onepage&q=Aka&f=false '''page 390'''] of Ann K.S. Lambton's ''Continuity and Change in Medieval Persia.'' Here she is named the daughter of Mas'ud b. Muhammad and wife of her cousin, Muhammad b. Mahmud.
