2 CONT * Cao Daoheng and Shen Yucheng, Zhongguo wenxuejia dacidian, 152. 
2 CONT * Guo Peng 郭鵬. “Lun Bei Zhou Zhao wang Teng wang yu Yu Xin de wenxue jiaowang dui Nanbei wenfeng ronghe de biaoshuai yu cedong” 論北周趙王滕王與庾信的文學交往對南北文風融合的表率與策動. Minzu wenxue yanjiu (2010: 4): 138–43.
2 CONT
