2 CONC . 1–202. ISBN 0-521-06936-X.
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. E (1995). The Later Ghaznavids: Splendour and Decay: The Dynasty in Afghanistan and Northern India 1040-1186. Retrieved 10 May 2014.
