1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Niketas was a 7th-century Byzantine officer. He was the son and heir of the Sassanid Persian general and briefly shahanshah, Shahrbaraz. After the Byzantine–Sassanid War of 602–628, Shahrbaraz remained in control o
