2 CONT * Bosworth, C. E. (1968). "The Political and Dynastic History of the Iranian World (A.D. 1000–1217)". In Frye, R. N. The Cambridge History of Iran, Volume 5: The Saljuq and Mongol periods. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press. pp
2 CONC . 1–202. ISBN 0-521-06936-X.
2 CONT * Blandford, Neil; Jones, Bruce (1985). The World's Most Evil Men.
2 CONT * Cawthorne, Nigel (1999). The World's Worst Atrocities.
