2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT His reign signifies the promotion and possibly even the creation of the Silk Road between ancient China, India, and the western world.[39] Richard Frye makes the argument that Khosrau's rationale behind his numerous wars with the 
2 CONC Byzantine empire as well as the eastern Hephthalites was to establish the Sassanian dominance on this trade route.[
