2 CONC and Cheynet name him Theodoros, but the primary source on which this is based has not been identified[221].  m SOPHIA Komnene, daughter of ISAAKIOS Komnenos sébastokrator & his wife Irena of Georgia.  Gautier records that Sofia, d
2 CONC aughter of Isaakios, married “un sebaste Dokeianos” and that she became a nun as SUZANNA after the death of her husband[222].  1108.  Nikolaos Dokeianos & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT **a)         ISAAKIOS Dokeianos .  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified. 
2 CONT **b)         EIRENE Dokeiana .  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not yet been identified. 
