1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghaznavids#Family_tree_of_the_Ghaznavid_sultans '''Hurra-yi Kalji'''], Princess, married Mamunid ruler Ma'mun II.
2 CONT
2 CONT From the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khwarazmian_dynasty '''Wikipedia page'''] of the Khwarazmian dynasty:
2 CONT
2 CONT The date of the founding of the Khwarazmian dynasty remains debatable. During a revolt in 1017, Khwarezmian rebels murdered Abu'l-Abbas Ma'mun and his wife, Hurra-ji, sister of the Ghaznavid sultan Mahmud.[15] In response, Mahmud 
2 CONC invaded and occupied the region of Khwarezm, which included Nasa and the ribat of Farawa.[16] As a result, Khwarezm became a province of the Ghaznavid Empire from 1017 to 1034.
2 CONT
2 CONT =References=
