2 CONT From the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ma%27mun_II '''Wikipedia page'''] of her husband, Ma'mun II:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ma'mun also married Mahmud's sister Hurra-yi Kalji, who had previously been married to his brother, in 1015 or 1016.[1].
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTE:''' The Wikipedia page does not state whether Hurra-yi Kalij was married to Ma'mun II's brother Abu al-Hasan Ali or to another brother, but it is likely that the brother in question was Abu al-Hasan Ali.
2 CONT
