2 CONT * Wu Guoping 烏國平. “Lun Liangdai shiren Xiao Zong” 論梁代詩人蕭綜. Wenxue yichan (2009: 5): 53–61. 
2 CONT * Ge Zhiwei 葛志偉. “Xiao Zong shengzu nian kao” 蕭綜生卒年考. Wen xuan yichan (2009: 5): 61.
