1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Terken Khatun also known as Turkan Khatun ("the Queen of the Turks") was the Empress of the Khwarazmian Empire as the wife of Shah Il-Arslan, and the mother of Tekish and Sultan-Shah of the Khwarazmian Empire.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
