1 CONC Amida (Diyarbakir) and Arzn in 895.8 He lost Kars, along with his queen, it's other noble women, and it's treasure, to Afshin in 897.7 He crowned Adarnase as King of Iberia in 899.7 He crowned Constantine as King of Abasgia (moder
1 CONC n Abkhazia) circa 904.7 He was attacked by Yusuf and Gagik, King of Vaspurakan, in 910.9 He was taken prisoner by the Saracen military commander Bulkasim and tortured "for one full year" in 913. He died in 914 in Duin. He was stra
1 CONC ngled, and then hanged on wood so that he shared the death and Cross of Christ, crucified.3,4,10,9  
